      "title": "Dividend increased to ₹0.44",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹0.44 is 13% higher than last year. Ex-date: 4th May 2026 Payment date: 1st January 1970 Dividend yield will be 1.7%, which is higher than the industry average of 1.1%. Sustainability & Growth The dividend has decreased over the past 10 years, indicating a lack of growth and stability in payments. Earnings per share has grown by 67% over the last 5 years. Unless this trend reverses, it should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
