      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.21 (vs ₹2.06 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.21 (up from ₹2.06 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹116.0b (down 2.0% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹27.7b (up 12% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 24% (up from 21% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 5% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
